vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I0WnNU_Gm1UQ7kNvwEITUeF&_nc_oc=Admh5OtEEiQZcIpAzX-mGY5B_4_TmpZvlnc0byLr5TZ-Hy1dD_O-snNwn8DsvNK_aIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxdfDdcMcEw6FcdsP01GsjZyyHWpLLSKuf_Bw0NNGGlSA&oe=69BFE8D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PEr9iiakNLAQ7kNvwF0R5XW&_nc_oc=AdmDlK30c5SKnL2rDV4jgIpsSxzbdtiGCIlSVMGiuUswUjXR2J3GD5o1EsPsf3ntT4A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyLZ1ybwNYX_9ZRrkDPRP3B2Ptif41iN4qQKLJBcpSowQ&oe=69BFEDB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UIiqcLPzsJAQ7kNvwF2OxW_&_nc_oc=AdnID6pQr8CAZ6jAjU_zxzFEzD9ZLOpdq8lTyxRwAylxG4oYjekrN8OeE3jmkt4Cfks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzsjDvUzuTXw8wG4ghKX9f1CT_0qyOiFt32CuVL7GQCmQ&oe=69BFFB55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "